# Render: node <vhs>/dist/cli.js assets/tapes/release.tape (from the repo root)
Output assets/release.gif
Set Width 1000
Set Height 400
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type `export PS1="> " PATH="$PWD/assets/tapes/bin:$PATH" && gum --version >/dev/null && clear`
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Type "bash examples/release.sh"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
